    "expected": {"mean": 2.5, "sigma": 3.3541019662496847, "marks": [{"id": 6, "level": 2}]},
    "note": "n = 6: mean 15 / 6 = 2.5; variance (5 x 1.5^2 + 7.5^2) / 6 = 67.5 / 6 = 11.25, sigma = sqrt(11.25) = 3.3541; mean + 2 sigma = 9.208 <= 10 < mean + 3 sigma = 12.56 -> tree 6 at level 2."
  },
